        <activityName xml:lang="en">Steel, electric, alloyed, 44FMn28, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Steel, electric, alloyed, 44FMn28, at plant
This process produces secondary steel. Only scrap is used as iron bearing input.;
UUID: 6f8e8891-f14a-3294-b235-f65f3ecf6533
Transports of scrap metal and other input materials to electric arc furnace, steel making process and casting.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Industry data.
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Data from industry, referring to Switzerland 
Extrapolations: Some generic datasets from ecoinvent have been used.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_6f8e8891-f14a-3294-b235-f65f3ecf6533.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
